# LNReader integration: the Phase 4 handoff note is still French-language,
# session-scratch planning text (unlike the rest of docs/lnreader/, cleaned
# up and committed) -- kept local until it's translated or rewritten.
docs/lnreader/PHASE4_HANDOFF.md

# LNReader integration: local server home directory used for real,
# end-to-end manual testing against the live HTTP API (see
# docs/lnreader/REFERENCE.md §6) -- installed sources/downloads/database
# churn on every test run, not meant for git history; the settings.json
# fixture itself is reproducible from REFERENCE.md if it's ever lost.
docs/lnreader/test_home/

# LNReader integration: real plugin sources vendored locally for one-off
# manual validation against real sites during development (see
# faisabilite-v2-adapter-rakuyomi.md §10.6) -- never committed, even with
# MIT attribution, same as Aidoku never committing vendored test sources.
backend/shared/src/source/sdk_lnreader/test_fixtures/

# Claude Code's own runtime state for this repo (scheduled tasks, worktree/
# checkpoint/mailbox bookkeeping, agent registry/memory) -- tooling-local,
# regenerated per machine, never meant to be shared via git. Previously
# only excluded per-clone via .git/info/exclude (not shared with a fresh
# clone); formalized here so it can't be accidentally committed from any
# checkout.
.claude/
